# Wallet Management System

A production-style wallet service built as part of the Lendsqr Backend Engineering Assessment.

The application allows users to:

- Register
- Login
- Automatically receive a wallet
- Fund wallet
- Transfer money
- Withdraw money
- View transaction history

During registration every user is verified against the Lendsqr Adjutor Karma blacklist before onboarding.

The project follows a layered architecture and applies transaction-safe wallet operations using MySQL transactions and row-level locking.

---

