# Architecture

The project follows a layered architecture.

```
Controller
↓

Service
↓

Repository
↓

Database
```

### Controller

Responsible for

- handling HTTP requests
- returning responses

Contains zero business logic.

---

### Service

Contains all business rules.

Examples

- user registration
- transfer validation
- wallet funding
- balance checks

---

### Repository

Responsible for database interaction only.

Contains

- create
- update
- find
- delete

No business logic exists here.

---

### Database

MySQL using Knex Query Builder.

All money movement is wrapped inside database transactions.

---

