# Database Design

The system uses three core tables.

### users

Stores customer information.

### wallets

Stores wallet balances.

One wallet belongs to one user.

### transactions

Stores immutable ledger entries.

Every balance update generates a transaction record.

Balances are never modified without recording a transaction.

---

# ER Diagram

(Check here for the ERD => https://dbdiagram.io/d/6a68aa13c3a90dd98dd163bd OR this directory for visuals => lendsqr-wallet-service/docs/er-diagram.png)

```

    USERS ||--|| WALLETS : owns
    WALLETS ||--o{ TRANSACTIONS : records

    USERS {
        bigint id PK
        uuid uuid
        string first_name
        string last_name
        string email
        string phone_number
    }

    WALLETS {
        bigint id PK
        bigint user_id FK
        decimal balance
        string currency
    }

    TRANSACTIONS {
        bigint id PK
        bigint wallet_id FK
        string reference
        decimal amount
        string type
        string direction
        string status
    }
```



